<deviceset name="WE-CSIM_4020" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:54128282/1" prefix="L">
<description>WE-CSIM Co-Sintered Inductor for Multiphase Applications

Characteristics
Ultra-Low RDC for maximum efficiency
Wide inductance range [10 nH -150 nH] @1 MHz / 1 V
High power density with superior thermal dissipation
Customization available for multi-phase topologies
Operating temperature -55 °C up to +155 °C

Applications
Multiphase VRM for CPUs/GPUs/AI accelerators
Data center servers and high-performance computing (HPC) platforms
AI chip Power Delivery Networks (PDN)
High Power ASIC applications
Laptop/notebook power supplies
Power modules for high-end semiconductor/chipset manufacturers
5G PMUs due to its ability to operate at very high frequencies

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-LAN-RJ45

Created by Ella 2026-10-14
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
